{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The output includes detailed information about:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Supervisor control plane configuration (VM count, size)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Foundation Load Balancer settings (name, size, availability)\par}
