{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab ESX hosts in connected state\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Network connectivity to vCenter and ESX hosts\sa180\par}
